silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_05_avro_substrate_concrete_anchor#musictypedclaim a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.05_avro_substrate.concrete_anchor#musictypedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_05_avro_substrate_concrete_anchor#musictypedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicTypedClaim is the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{MusicTypedClaim}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
