silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_05_avro_substrate_concrete_anchor#sourcewitness silm:hasLongDescription "The sourceWitness is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{sourceWitness} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
