silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_05_avro_substrate_concrete_anchor#musicnode_8 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_8 is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_8}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
