silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_05_avro_substrate_concrete_anchor#musicnode_9 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_9 is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_9}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
